      "headline": "SOC Analyst | CEH | CHFI Certified | Digital Forensics | Wazuh | Splunk | SIEM | Incident Response | Threat Detection | Open to Work",
      "summary": "Cybersecurity Professional specializing in Security Operations Center (SOC) operations, threat detection, incident response, and digital forensics.✔ CEH &amp; CHFI Certified✔ Professional Experience:• Security Operations Center (SOC) Analyst at Cyberster• Monitoring and investigating security events using Wazuh SIEM• Deploying and managing Wazuh environments on Ubuntu Linux• Integrating Windows endpoints for centralized log collection and analysis• Conducting threat detection and security event investigations• Supporting incident response and forensic analysis activities• Simulating real-world attack scenarios using Kali Linux to strengthen detection capabilities✔ Technical Expertise:• SIEM: Wazuh, Splunk• Digital Forensics: Autopsy, FTK Imager• Network Security: pfSense, Suricata IDS, Wireshark• Security Assessment: Nmap, Nessus• Operating Systems: Linux &amp; Windows✔ Core Competencies:• Security Monitoring• Threat Detection &amp; Analysis• Incident Response• Threat Hunting• Log Analysis &amp; Event Correlation• Vulnerability Assessment• Security Operations (SOC)✔ Frameworks &amp; Methodologies:• MITRE ATT&amp;CK• NIST Cybersecurity Framework• Cyber Kill Chain• EDR/XDR Concepts🎯 Focused on helping organizations improve visibility, detect threats early, and strengthen their overall security posture through effective monitoring and incident response.🌍 Open to SOC Analyst, Cybersecurity Analyst, Security Analyst, Incident Response, and Blue Team opportunities.",
